{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0a\u2744\ufe0f Embark on an Arctic adventure and uncover frozen secrets! \ud83d\udc1f\ud83e\uddca</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/a2d5aa75c91c8bfbb69c53487a9f65f5.poster.avif?t=1757790747\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/a2d5aa75c91c8bfbb69c53487a9f65f5.webm?t=1757790747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/a2d5aa75c91c8bfbb69c53487a9f65f5.mp4?t=1757790747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your aquarium experience with the new Arctic DLC (the largest expansion pack for Aquarist to date) and immerse yourself in the world of the icy north. Your mission will be to explore the frozen land, search for rare fish species trapped in ice blocks, and keep the research base alive. \ud83d\udd26\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/2611eb88a9d23f8554c08bd6fcb648fc.poster.avif?t=1757790747\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/2611eb88a9d23f8554c08bd6fcb648fc.webm?t=1757790747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on snowmobiles, use radars, and scour the terrain for hidden treasures. Loot wood and metal from wrecks to keep the station warm, power devices, and develop new technologies. Create a thawing chamber, use special dryers, or treat an ice block to a special heating chamber\u2014and unique fish species and items will emerge from within! \ud83e\uddca\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udc20</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/c1c24ee4cec6dd039d30a74c3fac356b.poster.avif?t=1757790747\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/c1c24ee4cec6dd039d30a74c3fac356b.webm?t=1757790747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/c1c24ee4cec6dd039d30a74c3fac356b.mp4?t=1757790747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can place the fish you find in new Arctic aquariums \u2013 thanks to special cooling devices, you'll provide them with ideal conditions near zero degrees. Breed them, breed them, and unlock the ability to sell them in the store! \ud83c\udfea</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be up to the challenge of surviving in the frozen void and discovering all the fish species trapped in the ice? \ud83c\udf0c\ud83d\udc1f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/0c3b37c4fbc3c8d64089676fd4e83645.poster.avif?t=1757790747\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/0c3b37c4fbc3c8d64089676fd4e83645.webm?t=1757790747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/0c3b37c4fbc3c8d64089676fd4e83645.mp4?t=1757790747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will you find in the Arctic DLC?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 New Location \u2013 Arctic Research Base \u2744\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Exploration on snowmobiles with radar \ud83d\udea8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Minigames related to fish mining and thawing \ud83e\uddca</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Ability to upgrade your base and acquire new technologies \ud83d\udd27</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Breed Arctic fish species in refrigerated aquariums \ud83d\udc20</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Brand new species to discover and add to your shop \ud83c\udfa3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/cc66ef09aab744964cd74a81f44b3673.poster.avif?t=1757790747\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/cc66ef09aab744964cd74a81f44b3673.webm?t=1757790747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to brave the freezing winds and search for life in the icy desert? \u2744\ufe0f\ud83d\udc1f Immerse yourself in the Arctic DLC and discover what the eternal ice holds! \ud83c\udf0a</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930920?t=1757790747","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/4854b1ad3a4caebc8df6c3eb6e4e718b0bbe85f3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757790747","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/db1df519d81f306963cbde7dca5fcf6b32ffcb0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757790747","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/db1df519d81f306963cbde7dca5fcf6b32ffcb0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757790747","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0a\u2744\ufe0f Embark on an Arctic adventure and uncover frozen secrets! \ud83d\udc1f\ud83e\uddca</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/a2d5aa75c91c8bfbb69c53487a9f65f5.poster.avif?t=1757790747\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/a2d5aa75c91c8bfbb69c53487a9f65f5.webm?t=1757790747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/a2d5aa75c91c8bfbb69c53487a9f65f5.mp4?t=1757790747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your aquarium experience with the new Arctic DLC (the largest expansion pack for Aquarist to date) and immerse yourself in the world of the icy north. Your mission will be to explore the frozen land, search for rare fish species trapped in ice blocks, and keep the research base alive. \ud83d\udd26\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/2611eb88a9d23f8554c08bd6fcb648fc.poster.avif?t=1757790747\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/2611eb88a9d23f8554c08bd6fcb648fc.webm?t=1757790747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on snowmobiles, use radars, and scour the terrain for hidden treasures. Loot wood and metal from wrecks to keep the station warm, power devices, and develop new technologies. Create a thawing chamber, use special dryers, or treat an ice block to a special heating chamber\u2014and unique fish species and items will emerge from within! \ud83e\uddca\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udc20</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/c1c24ee4cec6dd039d30a74c3fac356b.poster.avif?t=1757790747\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/c1c24ee4cec6dd039d30a74c3fac356b.webm?t=1757790747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/c1c24ee4cec6dd039d30a74c3fac356b.mp4?t=1757790747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can place the fish you find in new Arctic aquariums \u2013 thanks to special cooling devices, you'll provide them with ideal conditions near zero degrees. Breed them, breed them, and unlock the ability to sell them in the store! \ud83c\udfea</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be up to the challenge of surviving in the frozen void and discovering all the fish species trapped in the ice? \ud83c\udf0c\ud83d\udc1f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/0c3b37c4fbc3c8d64089676fd4e83645.poster.avif?t=1757790747\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/0c3b37c4fbc3c8d64089676fd4e83645.webm?t=1757790747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/0c3b37c4fbc3c8d64089676fd4e83645.mp4?t=1757790747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will you find in the Arctic DLC?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 New Location \u2013 Arctic Research Base \u2744\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Exploration on snowmobiles with radar \ud83d\udea8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Minigames related to fish mining and thawing \ud83e\uddca</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Ability to upgrade your base and acquire new technologies \ud83d\udd27</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Breed Arctic fish species in refrigerated aquariums \ud83d\udc20</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Brand new species to discover and add to your shop \ud83c\udfa3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/cc66ef09aab744964cd74a81f44b3673.poster.avif?t=1757790747\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/extras/cc66ef09aab744964cd74a81f44b3673.webm?t=1757790747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to brave the freezing winds and search for life in the icy desert? \u2744\ufe0f\ud83d\udc1f Immerse yourself in the Arctic DLC and discover what the eternal ice holds! \ud83c\udf0a</p>","developers":["FreeMind S.A."],"fullgame":{"appid":"1430760","name":"Aquarist"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/8af514510454d323e070af1d51fc927b816f4f03/header.jpg?t=1757790747","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Aquarist - Arctic DLC","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["FreeMind S.A.","PlayWay S.A."],"ratings":{"dejus":{"rating":"l"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"5 Nov, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/421da6bc32c78cb562d80582232b7a58093be781/ss_421da6bc32c78cb562d80582232b7a58093be781.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757790747","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/421da6bc32c78cb562d80582232b7a58093be781/ss_421da6bc32c78cb562d80582232b7a58093be781.600x338.jpg?t=1757790747"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/2592e645d5b0d20c5cb2278e170b3b688c8d8ba8/ss_2592e645d5b0d20c5cb2278e170b3b688c8d8ba8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757790747","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/2592e645d5b0d20c5cb2278e170b3b688c8d8ba8/ss_2592e645d5b0d20c5cb2278e170b3b688c8d8ba8.600x338.jpg?t=1757790747"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930920/6e1e4894fb892b5bf9eb2515f3